cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Polymathic Learner: a visual learning archive"
message: "If you refer to this archive or any document within it, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A collection of twenty-three self-contained interactive HTML documents in which
  mathematical, geometric and speculative ideas are given manipulable form. Includes
  the 易 (Yi) sequence, a seven-part working model of change that reconstructs the
  I Ching's notation as a continuous dynamical state space.
